{"id":1219,"date":"2023-02-08T17:58:48","date_gmt":"2023-02-08T17:58:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bhide.net\/wordpress_files\/index.php\/part-one-for-forthcoming-book-on-uncertainty\/"},"modified":"2023-02-08T17:58:48","modified_gmt":"2023-02-08T17:58:48","slug":"part-one-for-forthcoming-book-on-uncertainty","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/part-one-for-forthcoming-book-on-uncertainty\/","title":{"rendered":"Part One of forthcoming book Posted on SSRN"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ive been hacking away &#8212; for way too long &#8212; on a new book, <em>Uncertainty, Justification, and Enterprise: Renewing Knights Abandoned Construct<\/em>. Im at least half a year behind schedule, but Part One is now <a href=\"http:\/\/ssrn.com\/abstract=4350162\">finally posted on SSRN.<\/a><\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To celebrate I tried to get Dall-E-2 to generate a book cover.  I asked for &#8220;cover for a book on Uncertainty and Enterprise, possibly with a sketch of Frank Knight in the background. I got this rubbish<\/p>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.pngwp-content\/uploads\/DALL%C2%B7E-2023-02-08-17.52.49-Book-cover-for-a-book-on-Uncertainty-and-Enterprise-possibly-with-a-sketch-of-Frank-Knight-in-the-backgroud1.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.pngwp-content\/uploads\/DALL%C2%B7E-2023-02-08-17.52.49-Book-cover-for-a-book-on-Uncertainty-and-Enterprise-possibly-with-a-sketch-of-Frank-Knight-in-the-backgroud1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1220\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Source DALL E@ &#8220;cover for a book on Uncertainty and Enterprise, possibly with a sketch of Frank Knight in the background.&#8221;<br \/><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I then asked for an image for Part One (Formidable Barriers, Forgotten Pathways). This was a little more plausible.  Still very much a work in progress Id say.  And I dont believe ChatGPT could write my book for me..<\/p>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.pngwp-content\/uploads\/DALL%C2%B7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.pngwp-content\/uploads\/DALL%C2%B7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1223\" srcset=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.png 1024w, http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ive been hacking away &#8212; for way too long &#8212; on a new book, Uncertainty, Justification, and Enterprise: Renewing Knights<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":true,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[39],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1219","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-knightian-uncertainty-book"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1219","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1219"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1219\/revisions"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1219"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1219"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1219"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}